nanopb (stubbed)
----------------

This directory contains a placeholder for the nanopb library required by the project. The actual
nanopb sources should be synchronized from the upstream project (https://github.com/nanopb/nanopb)
when network access is available. Until then, the minimal stubs allow the codebase to compile while
protobuf framing work is scaffolded.

Upstream nanopb is distributed under the zlib license. Replace these stubs with the official
implementation before shipping.
